      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Test results are authenticated workflow checks; live results are ten read-only probes and do not imply live workflow writes. Student-save stage charts require real instrumented writes; missing samples are stated, never converted into zero latency. Grade panels show aggregate rows stored by each source, not vendor delivery success. Vendor health is a read-only request every 15m; an unconfigured endpoint is shown as unconfigured. PostgreSQL and Redis CPU/memory are shared-container samples. Redis memory/client totals require a secured exporter and are not collected."
